OL,3,GNEWSATwo men arrested over #580,000
OL,4,Acocaine haul in Glasgow
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested after
OL,7,Fcocaine worth up to #579,000 was
OL,8,Frecovered in police raids in Glasgow.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland said officers searched
OL,11,Fproperties on Garry Street in Mount
OL,12,FFlorida and Grovepark Gardens in
OL,13,FCowcaddens at  18:10 on Friday.
OL,15,FThe two men, aged 19 and 25, were
OL,16,Fcharged and are due to appear at
OL,17,FGlasgow Sheriff Court on Monday.
OL,19,FDet Sgt John Rhoddan said: "This
OL,20,Frecovery highlights our commitment to
OL,21,Ftackling dangerous and illegal drugs in
OL,22,Four local communities."
